00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.404
&gt;&gt; So if a student is in our MS in EE
program,

00:09:36.404 --> 00:09:39.880
the students are primarily going to be
taking eight to ten units.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.980
Which is about three classes.

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.070
Most classes in EE are three units.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:50.040
