academic references.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.300
So people that can speak to your aptitude
for graduate studies.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:15.420
Former advisors, professors, researchers.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:18.070
That have really work with you in an
academic setting.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:23.470
So, this is one of those differences
between the GSB and our application.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.880
So, something to really take note of.

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.390
&gt;&gt; And any essays?

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.350
&gt;&gt; Yes, we do have a statement of purpose.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:34.160
